<!-- Vasca idroponica: a mano (Claude Code, Cantiere 9). Una vasca di metallo con l'acqua, le piante che crescono e una lampada su un'asta; ogni seme fa crescere le piante in modo diverso. -->
<sequence values="BMWGFLA" size="20 20 24" symmetry="()" name="Vasca idroponica">
  <color symbol="M" value="8a9098" name="vasca"/>
  <color symbol="W" value="4ab8d8" name="acqua" alpha="0.8"/>
  <color symbol="G" value="5ab05a" name="foglie"/>
  <color symbol="F" value="3a8a3a" name="foglie scure"/>
  <color symbol="L" value="fff0b0" name="lampada" glow="True"/>
  <color symbol="A" value="5a5e66" name="asta"/>
  <box at="10 10 0" size="16 12 5" color="M"/>
  <box at="10 10 4" size="14 10 1" color="W"/>
  <box at="3 10 5" size="1 1 14" color="A"/>
  <box at="10 10 19" size="15 3 1" color="A"/>
  <box at="10 10 18" size="10 2 1" color="L"/>
  <prl in="B W" out="G W" p="0.4" steps="1"/>
  <all steps="5">
    <rule in="B G" out="G G" p="0.35"/>
  </all>
  <prl in="B G" out="F G" p="0.3" steps="1"/>
</sequence>
